Z||000000||Haze_Performance||02-09-2001||01:09 AM||||I read in an Import magazine "REV" (sold in England) that all cars there were required to have amber rear turn signals. Now I know that the new Corvettes & Mustangs have the Euro type amber lights in them over there, but what about the Fieros?  How long has it been a law? Did Fiero Coupes come with amber inserts in the rear over there?<P>TFTS  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Carl<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>WS6 Fieros "Members Photo Page"</A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Vlad||02-09-2001||02:34 AM||||I don't think they have ever been sold in Europe. Folks just bring them over from America.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||02-09-2001||02:42 AM||||Hmmmm...... I wonder if someone brought one over would you would have to convert it?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>WS6 Fieros "Members Photo Page"</A>||||reg||10
Z||000003||Vlad||02-09-2001||02:58 AM||||It totally depens in what country you are.<P>Lets say in Russia, you have to have breaks and engine...:-) If you don't, it's easely fixable by paying tech officer 10 bucks. <BR>That's how it works there...<BR>BTW, there are 3 Fiero's in Moscow. Two of them - 88 GT.<P>In Israel for example, you will have to match<BR>all government specification before you can have your car licensed (some lights modifications). For some reason in Israel you are not allowed to perform work on break and steering systems if you are not licensed auto tech. Even on your own car.<BR>There is one 84 SE in Israel.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Tina||02-09-2001||09:18 AM||||All the info you ever would want. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.de" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.de</A> <BR>This is the adress of the German Fiero Club.<BR>Very knowledgable people there.<BR>I suggest you post a message there.<BR>All in german though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>If you hurry,(Time dif +7 hrs)you might even catch them awake.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tina.gif"> ||||reg||1
